  "bodyHash": "9ca394e4acac35b2",
  "content": "\n\n<p>这是&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-ore-excavation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Ore Excavation</a> 模组的子模组，旨在增加通过钻头获取钻石和绿宝石的难度。我制作它是为了平衡该模组，因为原版的获取方式过于强大。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>将粗绿宝石和粗钻石转化为普通绿宝石和钻石的方法如下：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span>1.&nbsp; 将粗钻石与 50mB 液体混合，获得加热粗钻石或钻石粉。<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AhMH6Zj.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"728\" height=\"428\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span>1.5 使用 16 个钻石粉合成粗钻石</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S867Pxk.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"732\" height=\"432\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>2. 冲洗加热粗钻石以获得冲洗粗钻石</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sWLxlgs.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"306\"><br>3. 切割冲洗粗钻石以获得切割粗钻石</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ph4bGBt.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"311\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>4. 压榨切割粗钻石以获得压榨粗钻石</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oZIZ7wb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"742\" height=\"312\"><br>5. 抛光压榨粗钻石以获得钻石<br></span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jHWph32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"744\" height=\"255\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>将粗红石转化为普通红石的方法也有些许变化：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>1. 粉碎粗红石</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ssdJpbe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"741\" height=\"433\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>2. 向粉碎后的红石中注入 100mB 的水</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/meSCZLe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"312\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>下界合金的处理方式略有不同：<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span>1. 钻取下界合金碎块</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hvros7o.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"728\" height=\"422\"><br>2. 煅烧粗下界合金碎块以获得煅烧下界合金碎块</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ezb6xBY.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"738\" height=\"310\"><br>3. 萦绕煅烧下界合金碎块以获得萦绕下界合金碎块</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KEuPGLS.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"734\" height=\"310\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>4. 烟熏萦绕下界合金碎块以获得烟熏下界合金碎块</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mc7MeLo.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"733\" height=\"311\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>5. 将烟熏下界合金碎块与熔岩混合以获得熔岩下界合金碎块</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SOZ6Pf8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"430\"><br>6. 溅射熔岩下界合金碎块以获得下界合金碎块</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XYm7Crz.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"733\" height=\"307\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>新增了通过压榨下界合金碎块和金锭制作下界合金锭的功能。<br><br>要开采下界合金，你必须使用终极钻头，其合成方式如下：<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y4oeDLq.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"445\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;你现在还可以使用流体提取器从主世界和下界中提取熔岩。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
